  "instructions": "Steam slices of sweet potato for 10 mins. Add 1 Tbsp yeast & whole meal flour. Knead to form dough. Let sit for 10 mins. Flatted dough balls with rolling pin. Filling: smear red bean paste & peanut butter, then form ball & flatten again. Roast both sides on non-stick pan. Sprinkle sesame seed on one side.",
